4. Apple IDs that automatically renew their subscriptions will be automatically charged to their iTunes accounts 24 hours before each billing cycle expires and the corresponding expiration date will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

